    "title": "No clinician assessment or plan documented",
    "message": "No assessment or plan was documented for this visit despite abnormal renal findings requiring action. Guidelines require screening for developing signs and symptoms at every visit for patients on ART. The rising creatinine, low eGFR, and proteinuria necessitate a documented management plan including potential regimen review and renal referral.",
    "issue_type": "plan_gap",
    "severity": "moderate",
    "recommended_action": "Document assessment addressing renal function decline. Create a plan for TDF review, renal evaluation, and ibuprofen cessation. Schedule follow-up labs.",
